# `cargo cicd git close`

Performs the lawful branch-close sequence: ensures tests pass, commits any staged evidence, merges to the trunk branch, and emits a GitCloseEvent as a receipt.

**Noun:** `git` &nbsp;&nbsp; **Verb:** `close`

<!-- END ggen:command-reference -->

<!-- BEGIN custom:examples -->
## Examples

```sh
cargo cicd git close
```
<!-- END custom:examples -->
